---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <title>Thank You | Travaza</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #050706;
      color: white;
    }

    .wrap {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .content {
      max-width: 650px;
    }

    .gold {
      color: #d5a03a;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 76px);
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      background: #d5a03a;
      color: #050706;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="content">
      <div class="gold">TRAVAZA</div>

      <h1>We've got it from here.</h1>

      <p>
        Thank you for contacting Travaza. Your request has been sent to our
        reservations team and we will review the details of your transportation
        or travel experience.
      </p>

      <p>
        A member of our team will follow up with availability, recommendations
        and next steps.
      </p>

      <a href="/">Return to Travaza</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
